    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loophole is a grid-based puzzle game about exploiting the rules of time travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a mysterious labyrinth on the brink of destruction. With explosions just a few tiles away, use time machines to turn back the clock and escape into past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past selves - the actions you just performed - will be waiting. Will they help you or hurt you? That's for you to decide. After all, they're just you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loophole is a grid-based puzzle game about exploiting the rules of time travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a mysterious labyrinth on the brink of destruction. With explosions just a few tiles away, use time machines to turn back the clock and escape into past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past selves - the actions you just performed - will be waiting. Will they help you or hurt you? That's for you to decide. After all, they're just you.</p>",
    "short_description": "A time-bending puzzle game about working with - and against - your past selves. Subvert the rules of time travel, dodge paradoxes, and find a way to escape the loop.",
